  PREPARING
  READY_FOR_COLLECTION
  COLLECTED
  IN_TRANSIT_TO_WAREHOUSE
  RECEIVED
  VERIFIED
  AVAILABLE_FOR_SHIPMENT
  ALLOCATED
  SHIPPED
  DELIVERED
  CANCELLED
